 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"What's this about? What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time. Just... be straight with me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Still on what got you through the first week.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Another time. The village needs me here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Here. I made an extra.\" Esperanza presses something into your hand — a decent tool, oiled and kept. (Useful. Keep it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? You're doing fine.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Since Giuseppe died... I keep expecting to see Giuseppe at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Wild Black Cherry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I sleep with one ear uncovered, always at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Please — whatever this is, it's getting worse — I'm feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. I need help. Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"It's not just the cut anymore, it's in the blood, I can feel it climbing. I need someone who knows wounds.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Giuseppe is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"With you leading? ...Give me a day to think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Giuseppe said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Wild Black Cherry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I should go. Before I overthink this conversation too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"You said shock got you through the first week. Just kept moving. What's carrying you now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Esperanza grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "🤝 Esperanza is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here? That's the priority.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Something shutters, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"What's the most useful thing you've learned since we got here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "A small chill settles between you. They're choosing words more carefully."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Still on the most useful thing you've learned.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"The Maw. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I don't know you well enough for that. Ask me again when we've survived something together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I tend the fire without being asked. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"The plan is the plan until it isn't. Then we make a new one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "You show them Wild Black Cherry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Rest when you can. We'll talk again soon.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"We'll see what the treeline brings. We always do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening…\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "🤝 Esperanza is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" \"That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Are you angry? At whoever did this. At the sky. At anything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Never mind this wound — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. Pantry's thin and getting thinner. Come forage with me tomorrow — two of us can fill packs.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Meet me at the ridge above the creek and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"They took you — The Maw, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "Esperanza nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Same as always: we endure.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "You show them Wild Black Cherry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? Before the scattering, I froze when it mattered. I think about it every day.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "Manaia seems lighter — something good landed recently."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "They grin when they spot you — unguarded, for once."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" A beat. \"You fed me when I was hungry. I don't forget things like that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Here's what it would take, if you want more than this: show up when it costs you something. That's the whole test.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "🤝 Manaia is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I saw something in the woods I'm not telling anyone about.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "You show them Wild Black Cherry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"I bound up Rafael — cleaned it out, wrapped it tight. Someone had to, and I know what to do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"I rinse the cup twice. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "Manaia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 51,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to The Red Table."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took me. Pattern Hunger — up there, on the screens, in front of everyone. I'm still turning it over.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "Halfway to the trap line, Yara freezes. Fresh tracks — big. \"We go back now. Quietly.\" You do. The wild, reminding you."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "Amina nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. Water's almost gone — 0 liters. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 0 liters, 8 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Pattern Hunger. They just... took Yara. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "Manaia has been stockpiling where nobody looks. \"Take half. You've got the hands for it.\" (+4 wood, +4 fiber to the village stash.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"what's been happening — that's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
