  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"The creek water run isn't going away — I need help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling The Suburb? I'm pushing 'The Big Beast'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"I tried the Wild Black Cherry like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They grin when they spot you — unguarded, for once."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about The Suburb last night — what to even CALL it. 'Big Ugly' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "🤝 Amina is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
