    "giftSample": [
     "They take back the trust your gift earned. (Trust -13.)",
     "💛 You hold Seed packet. Pressed into your hand with an order: keep people fed through winter. Seeds are a plan. Plans are how you stop being helpless. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived"
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "🧳 Word from The Bloodied II: Victor was killed — Fatima did it, they say. (The truth: dead is dead; the killing part is gossip.)",
     "Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. Not yet. The table is being set for those whose deeds are done, and yours are not done. The ledger still want",
